{"page":555,"verses":[{"verse_key":"63:5","surah":63,"ayah":5,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمْ تَعَالَوْا۟ يَسْتَغْفِرْ لَكُمْ رَسُولُ ٱللَّهِ لَوَّوْا۟ رُءُوسَهُمْ وَرَأَيْتَهُمْ يَصُدُّونَ وَهُم مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They turn their heads away in disdain when they are told, ‘Come, so that the Messenger of God may ask forgiveness for you,’ and you see them walking away arrogantly.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَعَالَوْا۟","en_gloss":"Come","transliteration":"taʿālaw","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"will ask forgiveness","transliteration":"yastaghfir","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":7,"ar":"رَسُولُ","en_gloss":"(the) Messenger","transliteration":"rasūlu","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَوَّوْا۟","en_gloss":"They turn aside","transliteration":"lawwaw","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":10,"ar":"رُءُوسَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their heads","transliteration":"ruūsahum","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَرَأَيْتَهُمْ","en_gloss":"and you see them","transliteration":"wara-aytahum","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يَصُدُّونَ","en_gloss":"turning away","transliteration":"yaṣuddūna","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُم","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّسْتَكْبِرُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) arrogant","transliteration":"mus'takbirūna","verse_key":"63:5"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٥","en_gloss":"(5)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"63:5"}]},{"verse_key":"63:6","surah":63,"ayah":6,"ar_uthmani":"سَوَآءٌ عَلَيْهِمْ أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ لَهُمْ أَمْ لَمْ تَسْتَغْفِرْ لَهُمْ لَن يَغْفِرَ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ لَا يَهْدِى ٱلْقَوْمَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"It makes no difference whether you ask forgiveness for them or not, God will not forgive them: God does not guide such treacherous people.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَوَآءٌ","en_gloss":"(It) is same","transliteration":"sawāon","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَسْتَغْفَرْتَ","en_gloss":"whether you ask forgiveness","transliteration":"astaghfarta","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":7,"ar":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","en_gloss":"ask forgiveness","transliteration":"tastaghfir","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":8,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"Never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَغْفِرَ","en_gloss":"will forgive","transliteration":"yaghfira","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَهُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"[to] them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":15,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(does) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guide","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":17,"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","en_gloss":"the people","transliteration":"l-qawma","verse_key":"63:6"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the defiantly disobedient","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","verse