samāwāti","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"and the earth","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ","en_gloss":"the hypocrites","transliteration":"l-munāfiqīna","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":19,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":20,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"63:7"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٧","en_gloss":"(7)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"63:7"}]},{"verse_key":"63:8","surah":63,"ayah":8,"ar_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ لَئِن رَّجَعْنَآ إِلَى ٱلْمَدِينَةِ لَيُخْرِجَنَّ ٱلْأَعَزُّ مِنْهَا ٱلْأَذَلَّ ۚ وَلِلَّهِ ٱلْعِزَّةُ وَلِرَسُولِهِۦ وَلِلْمُؤْمِنِينَ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱلْمُنَـٰفِقِينَ لَا يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They say, ‘Once we return to Medina the powerful will drive out the weak,’ but power belongs to God, to His Messenger, and to the believers, though the hypocrites do not know this.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَقُولُونَ","en_gloss":"They say","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَئِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"la-in","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رَّجَعْنَآ","en_gloss":"we return","transliteration":"rajaʿnā","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","en_gloss":"Al-Madinah","transliteration":"l-madīnati","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَيُخْرِجَنَّ","en_gloss":"surely, will expel","transliteration":"layukh'rijanna","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْأَعَزُّ","en_gloss":"the more honorable","transliteration":"l-aʿazu","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِنْهَا","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلْأَذَلَّ ۚ","en_gloss":"the more humble","transliteration":"l-adhala","verse_key":"63:8"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَلِلَّهِ","